      "problemStatement": "用幂级数方法求下列数项级数的和：\n(1) $\\\\sum_{n=1}^{\\\\infty}\\\\dfrac{n}{2^n}$；\n(2) $\\\\sum_{n=1}^{\\\\infty}\\\\dfrac{n^2}{3^n}$。",
      "solution": "(1) 令 $f(x)=\\\\sum_{n=1}^\\\\infty nx^n=x\\\\sum_{n=1}^\\\\infty nx^{n-1}=x\\\\cdot\\\\frac{1}{(1-x)^2}=\\\\frac{x}{(1-x)^2}$（$|x|<1$）。\n代入 $x=1/2$：$\\\\sum_{n=1}^\\\\infty\\\\frac{n}{2^n}=\\\\frac{1/2}{(1/2)^2}=\\\\frac{1/2}{1/4}=2$。\n(2) 令 $g(x)=\\\\sum_{n=1}^\\\\infty n^2 x^n$。利用 $n^2=n(n-1)+n$：\n$g(x)=\\\\sum n(n-1)x^n+\\\\sum nx^n=x^2\\\\sum n(n-1)x^{n-2}+f(x)=x^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{1-x}\\\\right)''+f(x)$。\n$\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{1-x}\\\\right)''=\\\\frac{2}{(1-x)^3}$，故 $g(x)=\\\\frac{2x^2}{(1-x)^3}+\\\\frac{x}{(1-x)^2}=\\\\frac{x(x+1)}{(1-x)^3}$。\n代入 $x=1/3$：$g(1/3)=\\\\frac{(1/3)(4/3)}{(2/3)^3}=\\\\frac{4/9}{8/27}=\\\\frac{4}{9}\\\\cdot\\\\frac{27}{8}=\\\\frac{3}{2}$。",
